{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Ar2Vmm8HHFEdrY28xYdovT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have the PDF content and the review context YAML. Now I need to dispatch a full review with 2 reviewers following the dream-review-full protocol:\n\n- R1: Methods + Experiments\n- R2: Novelty + Related Work\n\nThen conduct a roundtable: Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize.\n\nLet me launch R1 and R2 in parallel as agents, then synthesize their reviews in the roundtable.\n\nLet me carefully read the paper and context first before dispatching.\n\n**Paper Summary:**\nTitle: \"Why Hard Negative Mining Strategies Don't Differentiate for Code Retrieval at Scale\"\n\n\nThis is a negative result paper showing that four mining strategies (random, embedding-distance, dataflow-aware, BM25) produce no meaningful differences when tested across two encoders with multiple seeds at full scale (~44K instances). The core insight is that fine-tuning acts as a \"geometry equalizer,\" collapsing the margin differences between strategies by 65-78%. Mining strategies do help at smaller scales (1K instances) but this advantage disappears by 5K, and the paper also finds that BM25 and embedding-based negatives perform similarly, with pool size sensitivity creating unstable rankings.\n\nNow I'm checking which experiments were actually conducted against what was imagined—the paper covers the main comparisons across both encoders, evaluation on SWE-bench Lite and RepoBench-R, stratified analysis, and temperature ablation in the appendix, with dynamic mining and other variations still to verify. I've verified representation geometry convergence in Table 10, so the experimental coverage is comprehensive. Now I'm ready to start the review process—dispatching the Methods and Experiments section alongside the Novelty and Related Work analysis in parallel.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":43259,"cache_read_input_tokens":22938,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":43259},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66320d78-4e7d-4d1c-acee-fe19e7e4f482","uuid":"29f2de2f-e4ef-4762-b1c9-c639db7b1378"}
