{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012GdjcXifsgWqJVYV93T1fh","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| m2_full_starcoder | Full M2 StarCoder: 3 strategies × 3 seeds on full M1 data. Cross-encoder validation — if embedding > random holds for both Qwen and StarCoder, method is encoder-agnostic. Resolves plan_013 pilot negative (dataflow encoder-dependent). | — | — | — |\\\\n| m1_reextract_v2 | M1 重提取 v2：恢复 28,276 个因运行时瞬态文件系统故障失败的 instances（82 repos）。CodeQL pack 已修复，端到端测试通过。预期将训练数据从 15,897 提升至 ~44,173。D022 批准。 | — | — | — |\\\\n| m2_full_qwen | Full M2 Qwen: 3 strategies (random/embedding/dataflow) × 3 seeds on full M1 data (~11K train/seed). Statistical validation of pilot signal (embedding > random +2pp). Go/no-go for paper claims per D018. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- plan_015_dynamic（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- plan_018_bm25: BM25 negative baseline: Dream 审稿三档一致认定缺 BM25 baseline 是论文最大结构性缺陷。Phase 1 (CPU): 对 M2 训练语料建 BM25 索引，挖掘 BM25 hard negatives，生成训练数据。Phase 2 (GPU): 用 BM25 negatives 训练 Qwen + StarCoder 各 1 seed，对比 R@1。（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **neg_difficulty_analysis** (success): Negative difficulty distribution analysis: 用预训练 Qwen2.5-Coder-3B 和 StarCoder2-3B 计算 3 策略 (random/embedding/dataflow) 的 query-negative/positive cosine similarity，分析 pretrained representation separability 跨编码器差异。MAX_LENGTH=2048 匹配训练设置。\\\\n  [neg_difficulty_margin_comparison](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/neg_difficulty_analysis/chart/neg_difficulty_margin_comparison_meta.txt)\\\\n- **m1_reextract** (failed): M1 重提取：恢复 28,276 个因运行时瞬态文件系统故障失败的 instances（82 repos）。预期将训练数据从 15,897 提升至 ~44,173。D022 批准。 ← 基于 m1_extraction\\\\n- **m1_extraction** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 10 / 负向 2 / 失败 2 / 共 28\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-42106: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- p2b-smoke-test: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke3: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke5: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke6: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke7: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-smoke8: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b-all-9runs: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_p2b_contrastive_training: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_p2b_contrastive_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- p2b_eval_all: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- m2_early_pilot: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- m2_early_pilot_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- m2_early_pilot_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- m1_reextract: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2314, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RebJsFgQrXLAep9UVGbVyi","session_id":"66320d78-4e7d-4d1c-acee-fe19e7e4f482","uuid":"e38ce87b-b2fe-4e83-aef4-b7da7f3f47b6","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:15:36.662Z"}
