{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RCxRHpnQ7YbviwzFftJwV8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# StructFuse — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 16:27 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer WARNING 处理：re-dream gate 标注 + plan_018 contingency + post-M2 时间线明细\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 | 更新原因: Reviewer WARNING 处理：re-dream gate 标注 + plan_018 contingency\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nTrue embedding-distance mining consistently improves contrastive code retrieval (+1.6–2.0pp R@1), correcting prior misconceptions. Structure-grounded (dataflow) negatives provide conditional benefit mediated by encoder representation saturation (observation from n=2 encoders, not validated mechanism). 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（post-MVP）+ 审稿进行中\\\\n- **M2 全量训练**: 18 runs 部署完成（Qwen 9 + StarCoder 9），链式自动执行\\\\n  - Qwen: random_s42 done, random_s43 running (step ~1200/2828), 其余 queued/watcher\\\\n  - StarCoder: random_s42 running (step ~4000/4242, epoch 3), 其余 queued/watcher\\\\n  - ETA: Qwen ~May 19, StarCoder ~May 20\\\\n- **Dream dream_20260514T075732**: Best=4/6(WA), Median=3/6(WR), Worst=3/6(WR)\\\\n  - 7 项确认行动已持久化（D030），framing + plan 已修改\\\\n  - **Re-dream dream_20260514T162530 进行中** — 验证修复效果\\\\n- **plan_015 设计文档**: Worker 完成，待 Agent 汇报\\\\n- **m1_reextract_v2**: 后台 (~71/82 groups)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] **plan_018 BM25 baseline Phase 1 (CPU)** — 已派 Agent，立即启动\\\\n- [ ] ⛔ **plan_018 Phase 2 (GPU 训练)** — **需 re-dream 通过后才执行**（D030 gate）\\\\n- [ ] M2 full 18 runs 完成（~May 19-20）\\\\n- [ ] 统计检验 — M2 完成后立即执行\\\\n- [ ] plan_003 SWE-bench Lite eval — M2 best checkpoint ready 后（~20h real on 1 GPU）\\\\n- [ ] plan_004 RepoBench-R（多 seed + CIs）\\\\n- [ ] plan_019 Pool size sensitivity — M2 checkpoint ready 后（~2.5h real）\\\\n- [ ] plan_005 stratified analysis（扩展版）— 0 GPU\\\\n- [ ] plan_014 temperature ablation — **M2 后单项最大开销 (35h real on 2 GPUs)**，时间紧可推 camera-ready\\\\n- [ ] plan_015 dynamic mining — 设计完成，待审核\\\\n- [ ] [Dream 观察] Effect sizes marginal → M2 full 统计后评估\\\\n- [ ] [Dream 观察] Temperature ablation contradicts story → plan_014 后评估\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream dream_20260514T162530 结果 → 评估 median 是否 ≥ borderline\\\\n- [ ] 论文初稿 (~May 24)\\\\n\\\\n## Go/No-Go + Re-dream Gate\\\\n\\\\n**Claim 1**: 预期 Go。**BM25 contingency**: 若 plan_018 显示 BM25 ≈ random（非 harmful），叙事从 \\\\\\\"correcting misconception\\\\\\\" 降为 \\\\\\\"systematic comparison\\\\\\\"。详见 paper_framing.md Contingency 节。\\\\n**Claim 2**: D028 — 等 M2 统计。\\\\n**Re-dream gate (D030)**: plan_018 Phase 2 等新 P0 GPU 实验需 re-dream 达标（best ≥ WA, median ≥ borderline）后才批准。Phase 1 (CPU) 不受限。\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **bjb1-42106**: 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB（专属），满载\\\\n  - cuda:0: m2_full_qwen（registry ANALYZING 但实际在跑 — 不要重分配）\\\\n  - cuda:1: m2_full_starcoder (RUNNING)\\\\n- **Post-M2 需求 (~120h on 2 GPUs = ~60h real = ~2.5 days)**:\\\\n  - plan_003: 40h (1 GPU, 20h real) — 与 plan_018 Phase 2 并行\\\\n  - plan_018 Phase 2: 15h (1 GPU, 7.5h real)\\\\n  - plan_014: 70h (2 GPUs, 35h real) — 时间紧可缩减/推迟\\\\n  - plan_019: 5h (1 GPU, 2.5h real)\\\\n- **时间线**: M2 完成(~May 20) → post-M2 实验(~May 22) → 分析+写作(~May 23-24) → ARR May 25\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. **ARR May 25**: post-M2 ~60h real + 分析 + 写作 in 5 days。plan_014 (35h) 是瓶颈\\\\n2. **BM25 narrative risk**: plan_018 结果为 neutral 则需 framing pivot（已备 contingency）\\\\n3. **Median=WR**: re-dream 进行中，等结果评估改善程度\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-14 | D031 修正：BM25 top-7 overlap 远低于 k=50 的 87%，大 repo 仅 | plan_018 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-14 | plan_015 缩减为 1 seed × dynamic_ep (~11h)；BM25 overl | plan_015, plan_018 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-14 | BM25 Phase 1 完成: 87% overlap with embedding_distan | plan_018, plan_015 |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-14 | Dream dream_20260514T075732 分析完成：7 项确认行动 + 5 项观察项  | dream_20260514T075732, plan_018, plan_019 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-14 | Dream full review 完成：7 条三档一致结构性问题确认，BM25 baseline  | plan_018, plan_019, plan_004, plan_005 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 降级待定：M2 full 结果决定 \\\\\\\"conditional benefit\\\\\\\" 是独 | m2_embed_verify, plan_013_starcoder, m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-14 | M2 剩余 runs 加 early stopping (patience=2 evals)，加速关 | m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-14 | Qwen eval@2000 确认过拟合，后续 M2 runs 从 3 epochs 减至 2 ep | m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-14 | Plan_014 temperature ablation 缩减为 2 strategies × 3 | m2_full_qwen, plan_014 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-14 | Major paper framing rewrite: drop falsified \\\\\\\"embed | m2_embed_verify, plan_013_starcoder, neg_difficulty_analysis |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4166, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RebJsFgQrXLAep9UVGbVyi","session_id":"66320d78-4e7d-4d1c-acee-fe19e7e4f482","uuid":"a1252e41-46d3-46b6-8a12-e9be3ffe5d8a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:15:37.659Z"}
